## Installation

### Create Conda Environment
Create the environment from the `.yml` file:
```bash
conda env create -f excited_states_NN_kgcnn.yml
```


## Folder Structure
pyNNsMD            -> general NN functions
nn_scripts         -> NN and reruns #####
submit_scripts     -> submit the NN jobs to the server #####
evaluation_scripts -> evaluate results

##### -> add this to your PATH